            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("This is going to cost me, but I want to keep some gold around for emergencies — I think 50 is about right. I’d better send someone to collect some. (<i>Cough, cough</i>) I hope I can lure these fish onto land. Maybe I should recruit some bait."),
